    <Name>INT_2021_0676</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0676","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>Against eleven shades of white and one impostor</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0676","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2021-05-05</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0676","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Agnès Ulloa talks about negative space and its landlord. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
